  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing IOM&apos;S Global Data Institute: Improved Humanitarian Assistance Through Enhanced Displacement Data and Risk Reduction around Migration, Environment and Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Data Institute (GDI) unites the power of IOM&apos;s Displacement Tracking Matrix (DTM) and Global Migration Data Analysis Centre (GMDAC) as well as IOM&#x2019;s wide expertise in a number of migration-related fields to build a solid core in the extensive world of migration data through a whole-of-IOM approach. Under the GDI, this project addresses two segments of that world that are of ever-increasing importance to a comprehensive understanding of current and future migration dynamics: 1) Migration, Environment, Climate Change and Risk Reduction (MECR) and 2) strengthening humanitarian and displacement data.</narrative>
  </description>
